inetests application must be installed in DUT\n2. Test stream url for a multi codec AC3 AAC stream should be updated in the config variable video_src_url_ac3_aac inside MediaValidationVariables.py library inside filestore.\n3. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_CHECK_AV_STATUS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file.\n4. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_PLAYBACK_LATENCY_THRESHOLD configuration should be set to some milliseconds to cross verify the latency during playback.\n5. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_MEDIAPLAYBACK_TIMEOUT configuration should be set to time to wait before checking for AV playback','79f75001-ddaf-4010-b570-6100e68f0a8f'),('014918e9-823d-4bd1-a24b-da744e5ffc97','2025-10-07 13:17:42.457345','2025-10-07 13:17:42.457345','1. Wpeframework process should be up and running in the device.\n2.Lightning Player app should be hosted','65c1c0b9-a6b9-4703-bd0a-ee4eddd4dc4b'),('015a08f0-ee6f-4ba2-80cf-e1fe8fdeb14b','2025-11-15 13:48:53.354965','2025-11-15 13:48:53.354968','1. Wpeframework process should be up and running in the device. \n2.Lightning Player app should be hosted.\n3.Streaming server should be up and running in the docker','04f4c38c-7dbb-4f46-8579-fb18ffba059e'),('0160b1d9-f6e5-4954-9ac2-e3b849575b58','2025-10-07 13:31:17.877833','2025-10-07 13:31:17.877833','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state else invoke cosa_start.sh manually that includes all the ccsp components and TDK Component\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script\n3.Connect a WiFi client to 2.4Ghz private SSID of DUT','dfac9a44-2afc-44c6-82d6-6f64e37c0ab6'),('0168b2ac-9e54-4ec2-9376-aacdcba2cc92','2025-10-07 13:27:47.590532','2025-10-07 13:27:47.590532','TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','b9f30e8f-ca58-4854-9c05-6c302a3850f4'),('0168e448-b155-4efa-bfbe-9a44b4657c00','2025-10-07 13:45:17.850398','2025-10-07 13:45:17.850398','1.Ccsp Components in DUT should be in a running state that includes component under