c-4dc0-9ee3-515599a4a712','2025-11-03 10:07:50.193777','2025-11-03 10:07:50.193789','Ccsp Components in DUT should be in a running state that includes component under test Cable Modem','a7a74c5f-baa7-49a0-a97e-c72a6d124a42'),('1fcfce2e-3520-453b-9ca8-08c89da6dd24','2025-11-03 09:16:03.849242','2025-11-03 09:16:03.849248','TDK Agent should be in a running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script.','4f9550ed-4fcf-4528-98ab-902ac547e5bb'),('1fdaaa5a-fe57-48fb-9eef-db97a703f421','2025-10-07 13:11:08.945471','2025-10-07 13:11:08.945471','None','3a65462e-5296-40c2-988b-5da1ab5ddb0f'),('1fdc6463-8c41-4772-b89d-a88de78f8430','2025-10-07 13:20:02.698557','2025-10-07 13:20:02.698557','1. Wpeframework process should be up and running in the device.\n2.Lightning UVE AAMP Player app should be hosted','b0d82365-04fc-4621-a205-94763823bcf7'),('1fde182e-329d-4dbf-96d5-06fd8ad679e6','2025-10-07 13:20:27.480129','2025-10-07 13:20:27.480129','1. Wpeframework process should be up and running in the device.\n','f71f73c6-6c3e-4064-9b83-d401426729a5'),('1fdf8292-609a-4516-aea7-c981dc6e45fd','2025-10-07 13:10:50.830667','2025-10-07 13:10:50.830667','1. netSrvMgr should be up and running.\n2. IARMDaemonMain should be up and running.','5e2bd4d1-753b-4632-924e-b874908c2993'),('1fe4d56b-c70f-4dbd-9778-6789caa417db','2025-10-07 13:16:17.645988','2025-10-07 13:16:17.645988','1.tdk_mediapipelinetests application must be installed in DUT\n2. Test stream url for a VP9 stream should be updated in the config variable video_src_url_4k_vp9  inside MediaValidationVariables.py library inside filestore\n3. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_CHECK_AV_STATUS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file\n4. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_MEDIAPLAYBACK_TIMEOUT configuration should be set to time in seconds for which the slowMotion operation should be carried out','e4360539-18f1-41b4-909a-3a638cfca1a7'),('1fe760d9-664a-4925-adf5-35f3a9e967b8','2025-10-07 13:14:54.284764','2025-10-07 13:14:54.284764','1.tdk_mediapipelinetests application should be installed in the DUT\n2. Test stream url for a stream with audio underrun should be updated in the config variable video_src_url_audio_underflow inside MediaValidationVariables.py library inside filestore\n3. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_CHECK_AV_STATUS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file\n4. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_MEDIAPLAYBACK_TIMEOUT configuration should be set to time to wait before checking for AV playback\n5. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_AUDIO_END_POINT configuration should be set to notify the point where audio underrun happens ','941e7b4a-b960-479e-8d27-888a4b6ced0b'),('1ff28e4e-cc2e-4a14-9357-4969f0dc8bcd','2025-10-07 13:27:14.681249','2025-10-07 13:27:14.681249','1. Ccsp Components  should be in a running state of DUT\n2. TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script\n3. The DUT should be in RBUS mode\n','af075540-510e-487e-bcdd-a80057874087'),('1ff299cd-82a7-4149-b41e-b9448a00112f','2025-10-07 13:17:33.943160','2025-10-07 13:17:33.943160','1. Wpeframework process should be up and running in the device. \n2.Lightning Player app should be hosted.\n3.Streaming server should be up and running in the docker.','59381861-3dce-42f7-999f-99576f086c49'),('1ff41966-96b5-4b3e-9941-2e0be88090ec','2025-10-07 13:12:26.876220','2025-10-07 13:12:26.876220','1. TDK Agent should be up and running 2. stress-ng binary should be available in DUT 3. Shell script file TDK_HWPerfTools_Executor.sh, Log parsing script HWPerf_metric_parser.sh and xml file HWPerf_metric_details.xml should be available at $TDK_PATH','e4ce1a8a-1f26-4308-8806-a8f92c00c463'),('1ff6a516-50e6-4c5f-8224-5d0610be3a77','2025-10-07 13:25:19.915687','2025-10-07 13:25:19.915687','1.Ccsp Components in DUT should be in a running state\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','1f5fcef6-1fbd-466c-b0ee-aaa68af68c24'),('200525ca-ca2d-4695-b208-587e1220dc28','2025-10-07 13:24:34.792348','2025-10-07 13:24:34.792348','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state else invoke cosa_start.sh manually that includes all the ccsp components and TDK Component\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','a6ba98ff-abc9-49b0-8e16-54c6150d977c'),('200d8555-6a36-4baf-8150-3dc4560bcfb0','2025-10-07 13:07:06.271689','2025-10-07 13:07:06.271689','1.Set the values in bluetoothcredential.config\n2. Initialize the bluetooth manager\nBTRMGR_Init();\n3. Deinit the bluetooth manager after test\nBTRMGR_DeInit();','8cd9170b-7c03-4dee-8c5e-df4c8a35c8a3'),('20229602-507b-492d-b3b0-8b5f3f0b1b43','2025-10-07 13:08:17.562830','2025-10-07 13:08:17.562830','1. dsMgrMain should be up and running.\n2. IARMDaemonMain should be up and running.','20e460a2-a257-4f8a-a854-36c95d3b57ba'),('203b1d5a-612b-4a55-a403-a7c8fa828e93','2025-10-07 13:33:51.514846','2025-10-07 13:33:51.514846','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state else invoke cosa_start.sh manually that includes all the ccsp components and TDK Component\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it Through StartTdk.sh script','7a3106d3-b126-4b00-a6fb-4815f2c29e33'),('203e7ec1-88b9-41bb-a4bf-c6d02a04d6bd','2025-10-07 13:08:57.051943','2025-10-07 13:08:57.051943','None','2a7845ea-7a88-4921-ad1f-d25ca6ed859d'),('20407e91-da88-45ce-89db-4c067366d028','2025-10-07 13:26:46.610458','2025-10-07 13:26:46.610458','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state else invoke cosa_start.sh manually that includes all the ccsp components.\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','bf27206c-7386-4274-8ec6-0da7aad749bd'),('20443ba9-4f16-45d7-b3e9-7b09d93a486e','2025-10-07 13:34:36.568447','2025-10-07 13:34:36.568447','1.We need to check the Disassociation log to check whether all existing connections are removed. But this disassociation log is not consistent across platforms, we have restricted our validation to check only the return status of the API\n    2.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state else invoke cosa_start.sh manually that includes all the ccsp components and TDK Component\n3.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','6edc915f-ab00-41ef-9c1c-f64504cce1f1'),('2048c71a-576f-4e22-a31a-d064cf82a079','2025-10-07 13:25:53.619168','2025-10-07 13:25:53.619168','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state else invoke cosa_start.sh manually that includes all the ccsp components and TDK Component\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','c159c528-c3ee-41f2-8d80-4cbac6620036'),('20501271-ae2a-43e7-8271-371b5e4aa60f','2025-10-07 13:11:58.435469','2025-10-07 13:11:58.435469','1. SSH_METHOD, SSH_USERNAME  and SSH_PASSWORD  must be configured in device config file\n    2. Set dcm.properties with rdkcentral URL.\n    3. Telemetry version\n    4. Set Telemetry config URL.','d317fbef-577e-4255-b227-0c1cc4d69da2'),('2057cb01-d6d2-411a-bf6a-a4ce8b8eac91','2025-10-07 13:25:30.409512','2025-10-07 13:25:30.409512','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state else invoke cosa_start.sh manually that includes all the ccsp components and TDK Component\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','a3d483b1-e96c-4111-8c96-d6d72cbc9078'),('206530eb-e489-47b2-ad7e-a0903282f266','2025-10-07 13:13:51.290904','2025-10-07 13:13:51.290904','The device must be online with wpeframework service running.\nAll the variables in WebkitVariables.py must be filled.','09f0befc-1b3b-47e3-88a3-5605608a82b9'),('2069a109-5919-42cf-bd6a-73b7eb549ab5','2025-10-07 13:26:52.854091','2025-10-07 13:26:52.854091','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state of DUT that includes component under test Cable Modem\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','051b7fbb-4739-41cd-8ff4-47eb63e6f4ae'),('207905b7-e273-4209-9e09-1e2bb3ceee77','2025-10-07 13:26:07.130223','2025-10-07 13:26:07.130223','1.Ccsp Components in DU