8fc2-4cd61c56dd6e','2025-10-07 13:06:49.450915','2025-10-07 13:06:49.450915','configure Aamp_Tune_Config.ini with proper 4K tuning URL','62e2b879-be2c-4249-9c34-c66fca15d67b'),('541b1a88-f8f3-44ff-b0c4-cba7ac3edc93','2025-10-07 13:44:47.809620','2025-10-07 13:44:47.809620','Ensure the client setup is up with the IP address assigned by the gateway','073fd060-4042-4d6f-af4a-c431d0ab0518'),('541c16d9-3f49-4e47-97da-fe561a05a253','2025-10-07 13:07:08.076606','2025-10-07 13:07:08.076606','1.Set the values in bluetoothcredential.config\n2. Initialize the bluetooth manager\nBTRMGR_Init();\n3. Deinit the bluetooth manager after test\nBTRMGR_DeInit();','c4ba0876-40b4-426e-b94a-aaa7e46ce88c'),('5440dde1-9b27-46d4-88c3-d4e22895d19d','2025-10-07 13:36:42.601012','2025-10-07 13:36:42.601012','1.Ccsp Components in DUT should be in a running state that includes component under test Cable Modem\n    2. TDK Agent should be in a running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','4c1b4154-5776-4fcf-b86c-b62260f75bb0'),('54432e75-694a-4b63-b6ae-a0be8c69f1e3','2025-10-07 13:09:54.373580','2025-10-07 13:09:54.373580','1. TDK Agent should be up and running\n2. Required a setup with CEC enabled TV connection\n3.  HdmiCecOpen should open a CEC driver instance successfully and iarmbus event should be obtained from device ready call back.\n','3ddc5bab-e207-4ad1-8dac-5fad3400e4c8'),('5456b455-7326-4dd3-b15f-cdcd6fc19917','2025-10-07 13:21:22.951658','2025-10-07 13:21:22.951658','1. nmap tool should be installed in the TM machine\n2. Open ports list corresponding to the device should be added in the device configuration file (variable $TCP_PORTS) available in fileStore/tdkvRDKServiceConfig/device.config file','2f71c10b-27de-45d1-8c32-3a1eb7d9b584'),('545c6a72-87c6-4fa8-8f8c-712958453d8c','2025-10-07 13:08:04.224121','2025-10-07 13:08:04.224121','1. dsMgrMain should be up and running.\n2. IARMDaemonMain should be up and running.','c1760b49-26cd-4afc-bc15-1b5265e97918'),('546b4378-a0d2-495e-b514-65266329f4f3','2025-10-07 13:16:13.423920','2025-10-07 13:16:13.423920','1.tdk_mediapipelinetests application must be installed in DUT\n2. Test stream url for a HEVC stream should be updated in the config variable video_src_url_hevc inside MediaValidationVariables.py library inside filestore\n3. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_CHECK_AV_STATUS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file\n4. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_MEDIAPLAYBACK_TIMEOUT configuration should be set to time in seconds for which the slowMotion operation should be carried out','5caa5805-0c30-4716-8ba2-d516470c631c'),('54709858-83be-4ff2-990c-f4f27eb51525','2025-10-07 13:16:10.248226','2025-10-07 13:16:10.248226','1.tdk_mediapipelinetests application should be installed in the DUT\n2. Test stream url for an HLS stream should be updated in the config variable video_src_url_hls inside MediaValidationVariables.py library inside filestore\n3. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_CHECK_AV_STATUS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file\n4. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_MEDIAPLAYBACK_TIMEOUT configuration should be set to time in seconds for which the fastforward operation should be carried out\n5. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_VALIDATE_FULL_PLAYBACK configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for advanced playback validation\n6. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_CHECK_PTS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for validating video pts\n7. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_CHECK_FPS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for validating video frames\n8. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_CHECK_AUDIO configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for validating audio frames','9012c6c6-3178-4e65-a698-f03ced502924'),('54751ee0-ea97-49e2-8ce1-a0409677ae8f','2025-10-07 13:12:39.011118','2025-10-07 13:12:39.011118','No','ae4593d0-93ca-48bc-bb4f-4d5d36c59aaf'),('54768851-299a-4d8f-bfe0-272899b2cd37','2025-10-07 13:12:00.210628','2025-10-07 13:12:00.210628','1. SSH_METHOD, SSH_USERNAME  and SSH_PASSWORD  must be configured in device config file\n    2. Set dcm.properties with rdkcentral URL.\n    3. Telemetry version\n    4. Set Telemetry config URL.','5a1524eb-3f45-408a-89fd-b410f62aae58'),('547f7f66-d137-4d2d-bad0-4dab5ff88ad5','2025-10-07 13:07:04.315100','2025-10-07 13:07:04.315100','1.Set the values in bluetoothcredential.config\n2. Initialize the bluetooth manager\nBTRMGR_Init();\n3. Deinit the bluetooth manager after test\nBTRMGR_DeInit();','16937b3f-35d8-4cb4-ac4e-e71a29901585'),('5482f2fd-148d-465a-831a-2edbdf92469d','2025-10-07 13:16:56.434121','2025-10-07 13:16:56.434121','1. Wpeframework process should be up and running in the device.\n2.Lightning Player app should be hosted','78007500-420c-40de-b700-e82e8f0c928d'),('548469e8-18b0-4495-bdd3-42d9fb87d765','2025-10-07 13:34:43.261372','2025-10-07 13:34:43.261372','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state else invoke cosa_start.sh manually that includes all the ccsp components and TDK Component\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','9daf405e-7a58-4260-8046-9bace4ae106b'),('54889f3d-6148-4711-830c-42670f52dba9','2025-12-03 02:35:13.524710','2025-12-03 02:35:13.525709','The device must be online with wpeframework service running.\nAll the variables in WebkitVariables.py must be filled.','f919cbf1-e1f1-4953-b89b-2b43dbf2a963'),('5499c6cf-c351-48ad-a0a3-3a9c799429b7','2025-10-07 13:25:28.092734','2025-10-07 13:25:28.092734','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state else invoke cosa_start.sh manually that includes all the ccsp components and TDK Component\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','5308805c-fa21-43dc-88dc-f3a2273733c0'),('549dd2ba-82d5-45e5-a78a-61a29dcc2aed','2025-10-07 13:08:51.860231','2025-10-07 13:08:51.860231','1. dsMgrMain should be up and running.\n2. IARMDaemonMain should be up and running.','63a5ec32-36cf-4717-b704-d54df005d3d7'),('549f44f5-a389-470c-9eb6-1a4606252d52','2025-10-07 13:10:24.806460','2025-10-07 13:10:24.806460','1. Initialize the MFR module using mfr_init()','0f8f3680-45a6-4e16-a9ac-1c30514e1ab8'),('54a4d6c3-7e06-424a-bbb4-2d9bc4d0ee54','2025-10-07 13:36:30.262689','2025-10-07 13:36:30.262689','TDK Agent should be in running state for both DUT and clients connected or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script.','ecca8267-c7d0-44ae-990e-c58ebb931882'),('54af388a-d5da-494b-978b-bc32439a0664','2025-10-07 13:09:35.769872','2025-10-07 13:09:35.769872','1. Initialize IARMBus\n2. Connect IARMBus\n3. Initialize dsMgr\n4. Initialize DSHAL subsystems','cc90acf9-d91d-4269-b30d-c370d5dc3c28'),('54d177e5-1b61-48e9-8218-b104d75e0a20','2025-10-07 13:17:56.082176','2025-10-07 13:17:56.082176','1. Wpeframework process should be up and running in the device.\n2.Lightning Player app should be hosted','3c75ef5d-200f-4c1e-b39a-42f1d2089dcb'),('54d3be30-05b8-4f13-a9da-efd88e4cf934','2025-10-07 13:21:20.167310','2025-10-07 13:21:20.167310','WiFi related configurations should be configured in the device configuration file available in fileStore/tdkvRDKServiceConfig/device.config file','eb547672-2bd1-49b6-b275-9c58f88aaa01'),('54d69863-5384-4cec-afd0-a621e1cbeba2','2025-11-18 15:35:27.984486','2025-11-18 15:35:27.984487','Ccsp Components in DUT should be in a running state','458c93e8-34c6-4c52-9a52-c16c69433e9e'),('54d798f5-0761-43fa-a214-9f0a3f9c34a8','2025-10-07 13:27:29.614915','2025-10-07 13:27:29.614915','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state of DUT that includes component under test Cable Modem\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','b9a104a0-e892-4a42-bc8d-029e16818db0'),('54dae1b0-04dd-4bfe-a58c-1f27ad967af0','2025-10-07 13:13:23.174209','2025-10-07 13:13:23.174209','The device must be online with wpeframework service running.\nAll the variables in WebAudioVariables.py must be filled.','fe528cdb-dcdc-4691-838d-f6e2df7cc71c'),('54e94d05-e489-479b-9ab8-9684205c1cf7','2025-12-03 02:35:13.916611','2025-12-03 02:35:13.916611','The device must be online with wpeframework service running.\nAll the variables in WebkitVariables.py must be filled.','1dbce499-a239-4830-8753-375d8cf889ec'),('54eda10d-640a-42b3-a176-908329d9f35c','2025-10-07 13:13:03.401779','2025-10-07 13:13:03.401779','VTS binaries must be installed in DUT','67bbcd60-676f-4881-9888-d4f3e5e27b0a'),('54eec91f-0cc9-4379-aff6-882cd04b4cc9','2025-10-07 13:33:22.959651','2025-10-07 13:33:22.959651','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state else invoke cosa_start.sh manually that includes all the ccsp components and TDK Component\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','a241d5a3-f749-4fad-9566-4e1748c72283'),('54febf20-3ba7-48b1-a278-b3d997d78a5d','2025-10-07 13:19:19.185265','2025-10-07 13:19:19.185265','1. Wpeframework process should be up and running in the device.\n2.Lightning Player app should be hosted','1d7af297-cb67-452b-b74b-c93917c8a297'),('5500417d-7dd9-4566-8209-7e36250338c5','2025-10-07 13:12:35.462073','2025-10-07 13:12:35.462073','No','7e539fa4-5db8-42ff-bda5-3d3aa722b85e'),('550297da-3210-4855-93c9-964815faee66','2025-10-07 13:11:25.110131','2025-10-07 13:11:25.110131','None','cfbc153a-c7b1-4f4a-addc-1958e8ba584a'),('550eba08-1e94-4672-a388-def6decf7a70','2025-10-07 13:44:48.997993','2025-10-07 13:44:48.997993','Ensure the client setup is up with the IP address assigned by the gateway','b60bd4a6-1436-4873-bbd1-d5459e12e4a5'),('551194fe-a20b-4cdc-b026-4a53edc11e43','2025-10-07 13:21:16.598583','2025-10-07 13:21:16.598583','1. Configure the values shm partition permission (variable $SHM_PARTITION_PERMISSION) available in fileStore/tdkvRDKServiceConfig/device.config file','248f3819-1151-4bc1-a305-239380a081e5'),('5512182e-6ac8-4851-8dc7-45e9a0f805fd','2025-10-07 13:29:59.456184','2025-10-07 13:29:59.456184','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state else invoke cosa_start.sh manually that includes all the ccsp components and TDK Component\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script\n3.Wan Manager should be enabled\n4.DSL connection must be enabled.','f1445be6-8f26-4d93-9cba-0723cc84ede0'),('551fcc2e-102b-4549-bb2b-51b36d36d0a2','2025-10-07 13:18:51.755834','2025-10-07 13:18:51.755834','1. Wpeframework process should be up and running in the device.\n2.Lightning UVE AAMP Player app should be hosted','5007a40e-015d-4ec8-89ee-f5dd4e231073'),('55282406-018b-4505-86d3-8a11f2edf506','2025-10-07 13:34:47.179927','2025-10-07 13:34:47.179927','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state else invoke cosa_start.sh manually that includes all the ccsp components and TDK Component\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','dd43a4d4-d9a6-4f8e-a1f2-47d77f764a16'),('552f9162-13ba-44b2-b145-8e41ee21e752','2025-10-07 13:13:36.452360','2025-10-07 13:13:36.452360','The device must be online with wpeframework service running.\nAll the variables in WebAudioVariables.py must be filled.','33715c75-4d12-4e3f-b868-d7fdf5d91c1d'),('5535412e-c7f3-4d9d-bffc-f404e35e15d4','2025-10-07 13:15:46.405151','2025-10-07 13:15:46.405151','1.tdk_mediapipelinetests application must be installed in DUT\n2. Test stream url for an OPUS stream should be updated in the config variable video_src_url_opus inside MediaValidationVariables.py library inside filestore\n3. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_CHECK_AV_STATUS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file\n4. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_MEDIAPLAYBACK_TIMEOUT configuration should be set to time to wait before checking for AV playback','0f39853d-548b-4eb4-868a-d26ef29a7be4'),('55365a6d-a5be-4b62-84b1-12fbd996dad5','2025-10-07 13:27:21.478839','2025-10-07 13:27:21.478839','1. Ccsp Components  should be in a running state of DUT\n2. TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script\n3.Enable RBUS and ensure rbus_session_mgr is running','c8eec4d2-b6f4-4138-9a86-a0d9bc2d01cd'),('553a26c3-a542-4a8e-bf8e-c33c6631e76d','2025-10-07 13:45:00.389742','2025-10-07 13:45:00.389742','Ensure the client setup is up with the IP address assigned by the gateway','f6682e0a-e47a-41cb-a76c-f3fc41debc36'),('55418a01-fe23-433f-a676-10b4d8b88ecd','2025-10-07 13:14:51.789754','2025-10-07 13:14:51.789754','1.tdk_mediapipelinetests application must be installed in DUT\n2. Test stream url for a multi codec OPUS EAC3 stream should be updated in the config variable video_src_url_ddp51_heaac inside MediaValidationVariables.py library inside filestore.\n3. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_CHECK_AV_STATUS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file.\n4. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_PLAYBACK_LATENCY_THRESHOLD configuration should be set to some milliseconds to cross verify the latency during playback.\n5. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_MEDIAPLAYBACK_TIMEOUT configuration should be set to time to wait before checking for AV playback','9e3efa12-24f5-4fa7-ad71-f872a88eb520'),('554268fd-f56e-43f9-a735-c6991ff8ca03','2025-11-15 10:52:50.500787','2025-11-15 10:52:50.500789','1. Wpeframework process should be up and running in the device. \n2.Lightning Player app should be hosted.\n3.Streaming server should be up and running in the docker.','c1e12b8c-b3c9-49f5-9c94-3b44db66166b'),('5542cd20-b11c-49dd-a46a-c220bfe6dc06','2025-10-07 13:11:58.114225','2025-10-07 13:11:58.114225','1. SSH_METHOD, SSH_USERNAME  and SSH_PASSWORD  must be configured in device config file\n    2. Set dcm.properties with rdkcentral URL.\n    3. Telemetry version\n    4. Set Telemetry config URL.','e1b31233-e6a7-4318-87e7-4726041d341b'),('55563f12-b631-405a-976d-13d26747d669','2025-10-07 13:17:17.353481','2025-10-07 13:17:17.353481','1. Wpeframework process should be up and running in the device.\n2.Lightning Player app should be hosted','aefc0ae1-5288-4626-8939-8d05ae0e0122'),('55577d30-41e8-447d-aafd-20e0b1317e89','2025-10-07 13:30:55.131196','2025-10-07 13:30:55.131196','1.Ccsp Components in DUT should be in a running state t