COND_CHANNEL_TIMEOUT configuration should be set to time in seconds for which the playback operation should be carried out','568dd583-c0f0-49a3-88a2-99e68e19e12c'),('5c25ade9-d19c-4b73-b344-afc0a2cae917','2025-10-07 13:07:08.371789','2025-10-07 13:07:08.371789','1.Set the values in bluetoothcredential.config\n2. Initialize the bluetooth manager\nBTRMGR_Init();\n3. Deinit the bluetooth manager after test\nBTRMGR_DeInit();','ae55c2a2-a58c-4ac9-85a7-c8c594dcf53b'),('5c30aec0-9942-4668-a60c-326467060ef5','2025-10-07 13:15:53.273961','2025-10-07 13:15:53.273961','1.tdk_mediapipelinetests application must be installed in DUT\n2. Test stream url for an H264 stream should be updated in the config variable video_src_url_dash_h264 inside MediaValidationVariables.py library inside filestore\n3. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_CHECK_AV_STATUS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file\n4. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_MEDIAPLAYBACK_TIMEOUT configuration should be set to time to wait before checking for AV playback','20d2dc70-2ef4-4834-89e5-3174e2f42c64'),('5c554907-6b74-40fe-955d-5ed633c00a35','2025-10-07 13:24:22.129738','2025-10-07 13:24:22.129738','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state of DUT that includes component under test Cable Modem\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script\n\n\n','71f8b8ea-0f88-4dcb-b049-cb74d073f173'),('5c644a02-6645-4f27-ae9d-d600ca5d7f7c','2025-11-05 08:13:58.750589','2025-11-05 08:13:58.750590','TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','1eb811c1-7d98-47b1-85ea-5e230337ef30'),('5c699547-c636-45f1-8056-caf237bc2e28','2025-10-07 13:33:31.913908','2025-10-07 13:33:31.913908','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state of DUT\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','a2cd3e12-ca4b-4f0e-b986-1d78a2d74a49'),('5c6f957a-5a2e-4838-99c6-dc6f817eacdc','2025-10-07 13:13:32.127171','2025-10-07 13:13:32.127171','The device must be onli