10-07 13:17:00.327992','2025-10-07 13:17:00.327992','1. Wpeframework process should be up and running in the device.\n2.Lightning Player app should be hosted','c852b3cd-f46d-4d4f-80a9-2ad4d9545fb0'),('65331331-e4e5-4c0d-a0c9-9e3be2c7fa49','2025-10-07 13:16:05.320670','2025-10-07 13:16:05.320670','1.tdk_mediapipelinetests_trickplay application must be installed in DUT\n2. Test stream url for a H264 stream should be updated in the config variable video_src_url_dash_h264_24fps inside MediaValidationVariables.py library inside filestore\n3. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_CHECK_AV_STATUS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file\n4. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_MEDIAPLAYBACK_TIMEOUT configuration should be set to time in seconds for which the fastforward operation should be carried out\n5. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_SEEK_POSITION configuration should be set to duration in seconds to which the seek operation should be carried out\n6. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_VALIDATE_FULL_PLAYBACK configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for advanced playback validation\n7. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_CHECK_PTS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for validating video pts\n8. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_CHECK_FPS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for validating video frames\n9. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_CHECK_AUDIO configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for validating audio frames','b337b950-39e0-4162-b046-4d6b5c4975c5'),('6533d0dc-cadb-4714-b6a1-64377c22ea5c','2025-10-07 13:19:41.277282','2025-10-07 13:19:41.277282','1. Wpeframework process should be up and running in the device. \n2.Lightning Player app should be hosted.\n3.Streaming server should be up and running in the docker.','28ba8579-6df7-4a04-8225-000afcd8f831'),('65341770-501f-42cf-b4d4-05e8f6293633','2025-12-03 02:35:11.426439','2025-12-03 02:35:11.426439','The device must be online with wpeframework service running.\nAll the variables in WebkitVariables.