ss should be up and running in the device. \n2.Lightning Player app should be hosted.\n3.Streaming server should be up and running in the docker.','18a8c59c-5a7a-49f1-9314-e97b14d640d7'),('80679d15-b54d-48d5-b6e5-fc0b7e72aa09','2025-10-07 13:45:44.547101','2025-10-07 13:45:44.547101','Ensure the client setup is up with the IP address assigned by the gateway\nEnsure that xdns process is running in gateway','d4b970f7-d414-4f0c-a8ad-66a822f02612'),('806c7271-a1b0-4c9e-858d-d0d7073e1a47','2025-10-07 13:08:20.640236','2025-10-07 13:08:20.640236','1. dsMgrMain should be up and running.\n2. IARMDaemonMain should be up and running.\n3.display device should be connected.','4ed2277f-e1d5-495e-baaa-b75abd3410d2'),('8079ba40-7e50-48a7-8f1a-728209491b7c','2025-10-07 13:30:07.095658','2025-10-07 13:30:07.095658','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state else invoke cosa_start.sh manually that includes all the ccsp components and TDK Component\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script\n3.Wan Manager should be enabled','8cc5f0c9-bb59-41e8-9138-fdfff97c67f4'),('80804400-029f-48ed-b506-53ec20b9488f','2025-10-14 02:08:40.382225','2025-10-14 02:08:40.382228','Lightning Shaka Player app should be hosted','f19167ee-0e5b-49a2-9ad7-e0dcfbbc28f4'),('808c74d2-53ff-4784-83a0-7b3d7bc085d4','2025-11-05 07:31:13.619259','2025-11-05 07:31:13.619260','TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','c5bcc3ea-fde9-4484-b063-1b617548f4f3'),('808ea56c-3280-41b3-9cc7-9e5150743a1e','2025-10-07 13:13:46.570915','2025-10-07 13:13:46.570915','The device must be online with wpeframework service running.\nAll the variables in WebAudioVariables.py must be filled.','c867fccb-fdd4-47d5-a738-c463b8082831'),('8091755c-fd1f-4b12-bb2f-7b03b484a6a2','2025-11-03 10:20:09.341879','2025-11-03 10:20:09.341887','Ccsp Components in DUT should be in a running state that includes component under test Cable Modem','77425329-3665-4f9c-ae36-a5e1ca68c3e