 playback','59feaf33-c45d-4a57-befc-b1dcbde655ea'),('853abced-2173-46b8-9274-fbef4d117986','2025-10-07 13:35:08.920163','2025-10-07 13:35:08.920163','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state else invoke cosa_start.sh manually that includes all the ccsp components and TDK Component\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','c47ac5cb-f656-42f9-8ffc-8a5842e667e1'),('8543b73d-66bd-4270-9914-6d65326fa652','2025-10-07 13:11:26.045162','2025-10-07 13:11:26.045162','None','7e2b5b42-41ef-4e3f-b93b-35c96e87de19'),('8552de66-bf87-46ac-be62-ca261d6ba9db','2025-10-07 13:44:45.508637','2025-10-07 13:44:45.508637','Ensure the client setup is up with the IP address assigned by the gateway','a4ab4033-d616-45d0-81f3-dbe983fb5b49'),('8556efbb-baab-45f9-a613-ba76e341b6c7','2025-10-07 13:44:46.966345','2025-10-07 13:44:46.966345','Ensure the client setup is up with the IP address assigned by the gateway','989c2d18-e374-488a-ba0d-fd4c54a88d99'),('855cda6b-0c16-4f38-9ab0-3e673da14059','2025-10-07 13:06:53.107862','2025-10-07 13:06:53.107862','configure Aamp_Tune_Config.ini with proper tuning URLs','194acd20-894e-411d-82e0-6bd0f1d395f6'),('855d09eb-d01e-42f6-bdc6-eb89b938a116','2025-10-07 13:45:25.515938','2025-10-07 13:45:25.515938','Ensure the WIFI client setup is ready and WIFI client is listing the SSIDs properly.','b87d6c8e-4a56-4013-b193-ee56a6c2c9a2'),('855d17ed-5c2f-40ca-a149-a4025d8e8786','2025-10-07 13:19:54.943163','2025-10-07 13:19:54.943163','1. Wpeframework process should be up and running in the device.\n2.Lightning UVE AAMP Player app should be hosted','7237dae9-d099-4218-b3b9-9e7822d51b40'),('85675ef9-5b31-498c-ac17-1be6a3860387','2025-10-07 13:45:18.896400','2025-10-07 13:45:18.896400','Ensure the client setup is up with the IP address assigned by the gateway','46871243-9719-4211-b2ba-440837d07b1d'),('8568dd05-c26f-434c-983d-2341a8d0c74c','2025-10-07 13:11:32.673886','2025-10-07 13:11:32.673886','None','9d382ae9-8993-4819-8577