yback validation\n6. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_CHECK_PTS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for validating video pts\n7. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_CHECK_FPS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for validating video frames\n8. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_CHECK_AUDIO configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for validating audio frames','14b6f333-e661-4997-a00f-03120a74743c'),('b759523f-8b07-4ce0-939b-e34c866ef48d','2025-12-02 06:50:39.909035','2025-12-02 06:50:39.909039','Lightning Shaka Player app should be hosted','07ab431b-84cd-4c41-94f6-5221dd43b5da'),('b766a222-9149-46b5-8d12-82b94557f18d','2025-10-07 13:17:02.067817','2025-10-07 13:17:02.067817','1. Wpeframework process should be up and running in the device.\n2.Lightning Player app should be hosted','73a05b64-3f85-443f-918b-95d17d6f7f12'),('b7688b65-4dad-46a8-87ee-59eb4241fafc','2025-10-07 13:13:32.334517','2025-10-07 13:13:32.334517','The device must be online with wpeframework service running.\nAll the variables in WebAudioVariables.py must be filled.','adc7e5b8-7a7e-47eb-8aba-932c29619126'),('b76ee691-61eb-47bf-8968-b56487133e74','2025-10-07 13:20:48.165781','2025-10-07 13:20:48.165781','1. Time in Test Manager should be in sync with UTC time\n2. wpeframework should be running in DUT.','e5583eed-8e63-413e-aef0-edbcd5025928'),('b774b46f-676f-4059-a298-bf410d78d6f8','2025-10-07 13:28:46.443624','2025-10-07 13:28:46.443624','TDK test agent should be running\nTR069 module\'s parameter xml should be available','d8b2d849-4998-493a-b6c3-f87336aab9c6'),('b77c246b-0b6c-4491-8429-68ae286e7905','2025-10-07 13:35:20.961955','2025-10-07 13:35:20.961955','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state else invoke cosa_start.sh manually that includes all the ccsp components and TDK Component\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','17435028-0336-4746-892e-77fb74f071e6'),('b79e9512-a229-42b1-a16c-489405c110f8','2025-10-07 13