EOUT configuration should be set to time to wait before checking for AV playback','d539229b-8f44-4c91-9772-7cedd370ce5b'),('c0f0f1e1-2f47-462f-b2d8-801cd611381b','2025-10-07 13:20:22.220042','2025-10-07 13:20:22.220042','1. Either the DUT should be already connected and configured with WiFi IP in test manager or WiFi Access point with same IP range is required.\n2. Lightning application should be already hosted.\n3. Wpeframework process should be up and running in the device.','a10ade98-92bc-4126-8b05-db50b3b42dad'),('c0f844f2-8167-4e7a-a677-d0a3d68754de','2025-10-07 13:28:39.366282','2025-10-07 13:28:39.366282','TDK test agent should be running\nLMLITE module\'s parameter xml should be available','e698d5dc-f12a-4086-b428-2fc46617005a'),('c0ff78b7-bfd2-4447-b2c5-cc027e7b8cf3','2025-10-07 13:09:48.657029','2025-10-07 13:09:48.657029','configure Aamp_Tune_Config.ini with proper tuning URLs\nInitialize devicesetting manager','6f1da4ba-4f9d-4650-8d73-4a81656c32ec'),('c1092b4d-78fa-4797-9b12-ef40988953e4','2025-10-07 13:08:07.533505','2025-10-07 13:08:07.533505','1. dsMgrMain should be up and running.\n2. IARMDaemonMain should be up and running.','d189ec1c-6924-4ae3-b451-8893c72bc7eb'),('c1140766-c30b-4197-a26d-fe6cae7d9d7c','2025-10-07 13:13:58.697624','2025-10-07 13:13:58.697624','The device must be online with wpeframework service running.\nAll the variables in WebkitVariables.py must be filled.','2ebe2648-5cf5-4124-96f4-5af35889a881'),('c115271b-d8fd-4d9d-a066-8cd4e251d1ad','2025-10-07 13:11:45.477431','2025-10-07 13:11:45.477431','1. Configure the values AppArmor_Profiles available in fileStore/tdkvRDKServiceConfig/device.config file','cc25de86-65fe-47c4-83e1-e5c4f6bae93e'),('c11de5ff-fa82-4344-bf4e-d265c19e4475','2025-10-07 13:25:13.515737','2025-10-07 13:25:13.515737','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state else invoke cosa_start.sh manually that includes all the ccsp components.\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','b8921761-8745-4c55-8fc5-2e61a5c7c2b6'),('c12a2639-e084-4227-8263-8960c992bab4','2025-10-07 13:11:36.302141','2025-10-07 13:11:36.302141','MEMCR_APPHIBERNATE_PARAMETER needs to be configured in the device configuration file','d30edd93-e032-4d7c-b200-718cfaf3bc73'),('c12b8544-4e10-4688-b69d-c59022cb107d','2025-10-07 13:08:40.718341','2025-10-07 13:08:40.718341','1. dsMgrMain should be up and running.\n2. IARMDaemonMain should be up and running.','0c050048-df2b-4313-a904-ee15a52d7087'),('c1492257-bde1-4227-bad1-cf4d8dbbdf72','2025-10-07 13:35:14.069080','2025-10-07 13:35:14.069080','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state else invoke cosa_start.sh manually that includes all the ccsp components and TDK Component\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it Through StartTdk.sh script\n','311773ff-e401-4b2a-b3ca-1b3abe0ef111'),('c14bfab0-5330-4204-87dd-705e1dc6cb8f','2025-10-07 13:20:55.146366','2025-10-07 13:20:55.146366','1. Either the DUT should be already connected and configured with 2.4GHz WiFi IP in test manager or a 2.4GHz WiFi Access point with same IP range is required.\n2. Lightning application for ip change detection should be already hosted.\n3. Wpeframework process should be up and running in the device.','d23035f7-8b19-492f-ab8c-3ddafd9f6efb'),('c1529988-a188-449f-baa5-d78447312f5f','2025-10-07 13:27:54.313961','2025-10-07 13:27:54.313961','1.Ccsp Components in DUT should be in a running state that includes component under test Cable Modem\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','fa8929e1-516b-4d32-a40d-4dd7d3ed5266'),('c1580923-080b-441c-b413-1e222a5c330b','2025-10-07 13:29:55.307683','2025-10-07 13:29:55.307683','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state else invoke cosa_start.sh manually that includes all the ccsp components and TDK Component\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script\n3.WAN Manager should be enabled\n4.Both DSL WAN and WANOE WAN connections should be available\n5.If DUT_Mode_Primary_Priority is set to 1 set the policy to PRIMARY_PRIORITY and run the script','8d40f64e-c57b-42e5-82e1-0f83da6692ea'),('c15be4b0-0632-468b-b285-6e533a40d12a','2025-10-07 13:44:49.472663','2025-10-07 13:44:49.472663','Ensure the client setup is up with the IP address assigned by the gateway','f7fd4e76-45ce-4e8a-984b-c85fd086269d'),('c15da22a-576c-4d4d-8266-dcacdddc0173','2025-10-07 13:18:01.766401','2025-10-07 13:18:01.766401','1. Wpeframework process should be up and running in the device.\n2.Lightning Player app should be hosted','3588650b-2bf3-4fb7-96c0-9fe94363885e'),('c167de3a-bcf2-4855-8da0-a338ac3da5e3','2025-11-03 10:05:11.883166','2025-11-03 10:05:11.883167','Lightning Shaka Player app should be hosted','6325e963-7f00-4cdd-8e1b-34894a287a07'),('c168b128-ba72-4270-ae32-7522292b9bdb','2025-10-07 13:27:27.821566','2025-10-07 13:27:27.821566','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state of DUT that includes component under test Cable Modem\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','428dd008-e273-4f7b-a7b5-ff88672d27b9'),('c16f39fd-91b1-42db-8cf9-a7752d794ee7','2025-10-07 13:45:43.283688','2025-10-07 13:45:43.283688','Ensure the client setup is up with the IP address assigned by the gateway','d736d038-e2fd-49ef-9afd-40f3c5236be9'),('c170af11-52cf-4eb2-8690-1819d570f826','2025-10-07 13:21:11.846960','2025-10-07 13:21:11.846960','1. wpeframework should be running','ff064fd1-31a7-45b8-8682-b170d0b315ad'),('c178cb15-b141-4bbe-b851-2cf7090a440b','2025-11-15 11:08:25.294494','2025-11-15 11:08:25.294494','1. Wpeframework process should be up and running in the device. \n2.Lightning Player app should be hosted.\n3.Streaming server should be up and running in the docker.','ae6c33c8-92fc-4802-aec4-2ccd0e05d195'),('c17c368f-108a-4ae7-a2d4-6f67b7041d96','2025-10-07 13:12:40.622225','2025-10-07 13:12:40.622225','No','52b5726b-f3cf-4697-8f88-570e7531f93e'),('c1857010-121c-41ef-a9eb-b21411308ea1','2025-10-07 13:15:13.804703','2025-10-07 13:15:13.804703','1.tdk_mediapipelinetests application must be installed in DUT\n2. Test stream url for an AV1 stream should be updated in the config variable video_src_url_av1 inside MediaValidationVariables.py library inside filestore\n3. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_CHECK_AV_STATUS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file\n4. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_MEDIAPLAYBACK_TIMEOUT configuration should be set to time to wait before checking for AV playback','d6657aa7-2087-4f1d-9b47-6c5e2c753cf4'),('c1b1c347-d592-4355-b20c-d82fa6dea887','2025-10-07 13:18:44.091518','2025-10-07 13:18:44.091518','1. Wpeframework process should be up and running in the device.\n2.Lightning UVE Player app should be hosted','0c1e87bf-692d-42cf-8327-e028934e6413'),('c1b308b2-2e17-455b-b3cd-bc30fee0e2b6','2025-10-07 13:16:46.225611','2025-10-07 13:16:46.225611','1. Wpeframework process should be up and running in the device.\n2.Lightning Player app should be hosted','03e00fd2-0b41-4e2b-912e-bbd13f0d4ec7'),('c1bd649f-dd8c-4d7b-a416-d360138707b4','2025-12-03 02:35:18.712914','2025-12-03 02:35:18.712914','The device must be online with wpeframework service running.\nAll the variables in WebkitVariables.py must be filled.','a7a1738d-e8d0-4cd6-94e9-89ff733ef899'),('c1bde26f-fd5a-4ab5-821e-b277a0250992','2025-10-07 13:24:16.600369','2025-10-07 13:24:16.600369','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state of DUT that includes component under test Cable Modem\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','25762f64-b3b9-45c2-90b2-4ddd9b91a632'),('c1c524e8-14b5-46ab-b07f-07970469ede7','2025-10-07 13:25:07.044501','2025-10-07 13:25:07.044501','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state of DUT\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','4625af4b-3edf-4b38-b61a-92242f97c4ab'),('c1f1a384-f6aa-4342-b2de-c62c65c03e50','2025-12-03 02:35:11.192449','2025-12-03 02:35:11.192449','The device must be online with wpeframework service running.\nAll the variables in WebkitVariables.py must be filled.','e0b25245-3d38-4333-95aa-8f3268c521b0'),('c1f39ada-a1a8-4dca-9781-b33206564f77','2025-10-07 13:44:43.306448','2025-10-07 13:44:43.306448','Ensure the client setup is up with the IP address assigned by the gateway','82a3f55f-8528-411c-bd4c-f09ed893ac91'),('c1f4f604-548f-478e-a0e3-6df2468fd24a','2025-10-07 13:17:22.467159','2025-10-07 13:17:22.467159','1. Wpeframework process should be up and running in the device. \n2.Lightning Player app should be hosted.\n3.Streaming server should be up and running in the docker.','966ab00a-ba06-4f05-a59a-9e0736a03175'),('c1fde26c-90d5-48bc-aa17-88f67cc844b1','2025-10-07 13:13:50.805514','2025-10-07 13:13:50.805514','The device must be online with wpeframework service running.\nAll the variables in WebkitVariables.py must be filled.','768b98af-7de5-46dc-90db-b47e550436b7'),('c203aaef-ce38-4874-a134-ce609d4ac5af','2025-10-07 13:18:36.743494','2025-10-07 13:18:36.743494','1. Wpeframework process should be up and running in the device.\n2.Lightning Player app should be hosted','71c1dba8-1189-491d-8098-a435d4e2c75c'),('c209757d-0eb6-4372-8b4f-5efea6ff72f0','2025-10-07 13:11:37.589406','2025-10-07 13:11:37.589406','MEMCR_APPHIBERNATE_PARAMETER needs to be configured in the device configuration file','649684b7-6ff8-475a-95f0-83337bcd7514'),('c20b9da6-ac56-4ad8-b03c-52f993e2ac1c','2025-10-07 13:21:46.784993','2025-10-07 13:21:46.784993','1. Both 2.4GHZ and 5GHZ Access points should be available to connect.\n2. If DUT is connected to Ethernet, the WiFi access point should be in same IP address range\n3. Lightning application for ip change detection should be already hosted.\n4. Wpeframework process should be up and running in the device.\n5.4. If DUT is RPI, the version must be RPI 3B+ for detecting  5GHZ SSID.','16ac77ad-e396-4769-8f26-565070b8f10e'),('c2278f11-df08-4995-8b78-ae1ce308c1b4','2025-10-07 13:35:43.098130','2025-10-07 13:35:43.098130','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state else invoke cosa_start.sh manually that includes all the ccsp components and TDK Component\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it Through StartTdk.sh script','b7767277-fc98-4862-b196-c374215d22a6'),('c23c5cf9-257c-4a6f-9e2a-dadfbcca070c','2025-10-07 13:11:38.700931','2025-10-07 13:11:38.700931','MEMCR_APPHIBERNATE_PARAMETER needs to be configured in the device configuration file','bcf02838-0dd0-48f3-9092-fcbd18dd69af'),('c242b360-9375-40f7-9402-86ca686e2756','2025-10-07 13:08:52.743517','2025-10-07 13:08:52.743517','1. dsMgrMain should be up and running.\n2. IARMDaemonMain should be up and running.','7b4e2950-6b9c-4676-a8bf-843c98038266'),('c24877cd-0ce5-4bac-b992-d3ec9561e5d0','2025-10-07 13:10:47.032793','2025-10-07 13:10:47.032793','1. netSrvMgr should be up and running.\n2. IARMDaemonMain should be up and running.','8b578649-f4b6-4246-8ce1-03b474b04985'),('c24a4112-eda9-4467-92c7-5eca6b31cbac','2025-10-07 13:21:32.072179','2025-10-07 13:21:32.072179','1. Wpeframework process should be up and running in the device.','af776e5d-d0cc-4727-a2ea-b6a5e69a5417'),('c24b7bf7-9a97-415d-8278-33a0a171daa6','2025-10-07 13:25:08.917240','2025-10-07 13:25:08.917240','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state else invoke cosa_start.sh manually that includes all the ccsp components.\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','a39306a1-2434-4cfa-b99d-b50aea5e876f'),('c25643af-4b1d-492a-8322-4780a76b05b9','2025-10-07 13:26:18.705094','2025-10-07 13:26:18.705094','1.Ccsp Components in DUT should be in a running state that includes component under test Cable Modem\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script\n3. Ensure the OVS enable and Mesh Opensync enable are enabled as pre-requisite and device rebooted after that.','6fe96db5-4145-48e2-9e20-5150e7309fa3'),('c259e5f6-9a51-4fd7-b8cf-2175be2caa35','2025-10-07 13:07:25.029134','2025-10-07 13:07:25.029134','1. Configure the values SSH Method (variable $SSH_METHOD), DUT username (variable $SSH_USERNAME)and password of the DUT (variable $SSH_PASSWORD)  available in fileStore/Containerization.config file','5e5ff84d-f7ea-4878-9b6f-e1bec05b8486'),('c2609d21-ac7d-471d-9ae9-48c786682263','2025-10-07 13:16:09.024226','2025-10-07 13:16:09.024226','1.tdk_mediapipelinetests application should be installed in the DUT\n2. Test stream url for an MKV stream should be updated in the config variable video_src_url_4k_av1_mkv inside MediaValidationVariables.py library inside filestore\n3. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_CHECK_AV_STATUS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file\n4. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_MEDIAPLAYBACK_TIMEOUT configuration should be set to time in seconds for which the fastforward operation should be carried out\n5. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_VALIDATE_FULL_PLAYBACK configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for advanced playback validation\n6. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_CHECK_PTS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for validating video pts\n7. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_CHECK_FPS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for validating video frames\n8. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_CHECK_AUDIO configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for validating audio frames','36b13e85-665a-4317-bf12-415aa7e53927'),('c27a9e0d-a2f7-41ba-8505-efd51aa5ad6d','2025-10-07 13:25:08.556650','2025-10-07 13:25:08.556650','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state else invoke cosa_start.sh manually that includes all the ccsp components.\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','7419bd07-3188-48c2-84cb-216f8cded07a'),('c2854c09-0cc5-42fa-8fbb-fc745868a1e7','2025-10-07 13:12:23.412815','2025-10-07 13:12:23.412815','None','3d8818a1-b776-42ed-995e-ff0836f30a09'),('c29ffd36-9595-4d58-bf77-083a904c6d50','2025-10-07 13:09:25.696239','2025-10-07 13: