hosted','b70f0822-f694-4ba8-b15c-beeeaa010e50'),('e275d6dd-5243-45f7-9d93-27007340ccb4','2025-10-07 13:25:09.185115','2025-10-07 13:25:09.185115','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state else invoke cosa_start.sh manually that includes all the ccsp components.\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','110d06a3-6af0-4f69-ad51-b731fb27fbd8'),('e277ccd7-8c96-409d-8424-a7fcdc543740','2025-10-07 13:30:02.005856','2025-10-07 13:30:02.005856','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state else invoke cosa_start.sh manually that includes all the ccsp components and TDK Component\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script\n3.Wan Manager should be enabled','5cc4d206-2573-439e-a32a-2c95f374820e'),('e281e032-c887-4463-904c-86a8e890ad9c','2025-10-07 13:16:09.328400','2025-10-07 13:16:09.328400','1.tdk_mediapipelinetests application should be installed in the DUT\n2. Test stream url for an MP4 stream should be updated in the config variable video_src_url_mp4 inside MediaValidationVariables.py library inside filestore\n3. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_CHECK_AV_STATUS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file\n4. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_MEDIAPLAYBACK_TIMEOUT configuration should be set to time in seconds for which the fastforward operation should be carried out\n5. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_VALIDATE_FULL_PLAYBACK configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for advanced playback validation\n6. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_CHECK_PTS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for validating video pts\n7. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_CHECK_FPS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for validating video frames\n8. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_CHECK_AUDIO configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for validating audio frames','f9a7491c-c402-480f-be64-5aa72a20e423'),('e284a50a-6780-46ef-998e-4f9f3cae25bc','2025-10-07 13:29:14.274855','2025-10-07 13:29:14.274855','1.Ccsp Components  should be in a running state of DUT\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','fb133687-fed1-4834-bdb8-d303020ea98e'),('e29234f2-385c-49bd-853d-3b6bb8fdef4e','2025-10-07 13:44:45.625739','2025-10-07 13:44:45.625739','Ensure the client setup is up with the IP address assigned by the gateway','4e50f601-c18f-4089-8b65-e2cc0ff9e6c4');
