led in the DUT\n2. Test stream url for an DASH stream should be updated in the config variable video_src_url_bitrate_h264 inside MediaValidationVariables.py library inside filestore\n3. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_CHECK_AV_STATUS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file\n4. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_MEDIAPLAYBACK_TIMEOUT configuration should be set to time in seconds for which the fastforward operation should be carried out\n5. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_VALIDATE_FULL_PLAYBACK configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for advanced playback validation\n6. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_CHECK_PTS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for validating video pts\n7. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_CHECK_FPS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for validating video frames\n8. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_CHECK_AUDIO configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file for validating audio frames','8861d207-ca8a-40e3-99c0-594077800ceb'),('fe65f68e-9680-425f-8b18-ee476dd7f652','2025-11-10 07:49:32.320374','2025-11-10 07:49:32.320374','1. Wpeframework process should be up and running in the device.\n2.HTML Player app should be hosted','364e4d31-ab5f-49f2-b79a-d286109ced8f'),('fe660f5e-895e-4358-92fb-dfb4334ef1dd','2025-10-07 13:09:44.335650','2025-10-07 13:09:44.335650','DTCPMgrInitialize, DTCPMgrStartSource','313fe1dd-eab2-43ba-b69c-16b6c76c00a1'),('fe68db8e-c26b-4d61-ae58-763688d22e15','2025-10-07 13:30:49.017600','2025-10-07 13:30:49.017600','1.Ccsp Components in DUT should be in a running state that includes component under test Cable Modem\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','5aecf272-2ae6-4730-80c8-15195c365245'),('fe6c8639-8584-49fe-aca7-f937b393e543','2025-10-07 13:45:37.290437','2025-10-07 13:45:37.290437','Ensure the client setup is up with the IP address assigned by the gateway','9478a2b6-f11d-42b3-a552-2e3b3f3cc320'),('fe7fe9ea-775f-437c-8e72-87ce5d93ba2a','2025-10-07 13:09:39.918626','2025-10-07 13:09:39.918626','1. Initialize IARMBus\n2. Connect IARMBus\n3. Initialize dsMgr\n4. Initialize DSHAL subsystems','0e9c5859-889e-44b9-842c-8bf0bcdda413'),('fe87ec1d-7c9c-477c-bb2b-bc50df1f9fe6','2025-11-18 15:33:02.256742','2025-11-18 15:33:02.256744','TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','56e8a3e2-7ae9-4a4d-bcb4-817c51c6dc1c'),('fe882ae2-898c-413c-ad1e-44f475c97cf3','2025-10-07 13:30:42.432250','2025-10-07 13:30:42.432250','1.Ccsp Components in DUT should be in a running state that includes component under test Cable Modem\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script','b9dfc216-b6f2-4ac5-ad6a-3cfba96f0714'),('fe9a8fa9-a467-48bc-a9dc-bbe0260186cd','2025-12-03 02:35:13.337262','2025-12-03 02:35:13.337262','The device must be online with wpeframework service running.\nAll the variables in WebkitVariables.py must be filled.','970a2d8e-7da6-4c47-b0ba-5de9fa51dd59'),('fea3f65b-db60-4430-86c4-5753192ea844','2025-10-07 13:30:11.325891','2025-10-07 13:30:11.325891','1.Ccsp Components in DUT should be in a running state that includes component under test Cable Modem\n2.TDK Agent should be in running state or invoke it through StartTdk.sh script\n3.Webconfig distro should be enabled else enable with custom image','9f15f08d-3b5e-4579-ba83-0c56c17db384'),('fea811c2-d4d1-4cc5-aafd-7d508924ad48','2025-10-07 13:14:54.884365','2025-10-07 13:14:54.884365','1.tdk_mediapipelinetests application must be installed in DUT\n2. Test stream url for an EAC3 stream should be updated in the config variable video_src_url_ec3 inside MediaValidationVariables.py library inside filestore\n3. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_CHECK_AV_STATUS configuration should be set as yes/no in the device config file\n4. FIREBOLT_COMPLIANCE_MEDIAPLAYBACK_TIMEOUT configuration should be set to time to wait before checking for AV playback','dbdb83ea-3745-4ca9-b783-d528f3427133'),('feb0fe8d-4301-4887-aa7e-4211f381a535','2