5','RDKV',20,_binary '\0','RDKV_Webkit_MediaFragments_LastOccurrenceApplied','\n      TC0055: To ensure that when a media fragment with multiple t dimensions (\'t=7ampersandt=3\') is provided, only the last occurrence of t=3 is used, and the video starts playing from 3 seconds.\n      TC0058: To ensure that when a media fragment with an unrecognized fragment identifier (\'T=3,7\') is given, the user agent (UA) does not treat it as a valid media fragment and instead plays the entire media resource from the start.\n      TC0059: To verify that if a media fragment contains multiple time dimensions (e.g., \'t=smpte:00:00:01\' and \'t=npt:3\'), the user agent (UA) correctly interprets and uses only the last specified time dimension (\'t=npt:3\') for playback.\n    ','High','M143','testscriptsRDKV/component/webkit',_binary '\0','','\n    TC0055: To verify that when multiple occurrences of a fragment dimension are provided, only the last occurrence is interpreted.\n    TC0058: To verify that when an invalid media fragment is provided, the entire media resource is played.\n    TC0059: To ensure that when multiple fragment dimensions are provided, only the last one is interpreted.\n  ','Mediafragments_07','401d2467-97b0-43f7-aba0-7e8604ed5a87','2132fb29-69db-4a8c-a079-44a344d6a63e',NULL),('5445ac59-8b26-485c-b214-6c429f4036d9','2025-10-07 13:26:02.287837','2025-10-07 13:26:02.287837','RDKB',30,_binary '\0','TS_ONEWIFI_CheckTelemetryMarkerWith5GhzBytesSentAndReceived','This test case is to check if the bytes sent and received via TR-181 and telemetry marker are greater than zero by changing the log interval to 5 min','High','M78','testscriptsRDKB/component/OneWifi',_binary '\0',NULL,'Check if bytes sent and received via TR-181 and telemetry marker are greater than zero by Changing the Log Interval.','TC_ONEWIFI_105','abefc226-9b25-4a4b-a862-5a8d416b597a','ea3ed5c3-285c-421a-8664-b7ca5d275d24',NULL),('5459ec0f-6e6c-43d3-9ee4-df0769c2af30','2025-10-07 13:26:55.452199','2025-10-