 does not treat it as a valid fragment and instead plays the entire media resource starting from the beginning (currentTime == 0).\n      TC0035: To ensure that when a URL-encoded fragment (\'%74=3\', which is equivalent to \'t=3\') is used, the media is requested to play starting from 3 seconds and ending at the end of the media resource.\n      TC0036: To ensure that when a URL-encoded fragment (\'t=%33\', which is equivalent to \'t=3\') is used, the media is requested to play starting from 3 seconds and ending at the end of the media resource.\n      TC0037: To ensure that when a URL-encoded fragment (\'t=3%2C7\', which is equivalent to \'t=3,7\') is used, the media plays from 3 seconds to 7 seconds.\n      TC0038: To ensure that the URL-encoded fragment \'t=%6Ept:3\', which translates to \'t=npt:3\', correctly requests playback starting from 3 seconds to the end of the media resource.\n      TC0039: To ensure that the URL-encoded fragment \'t=npt%3A3\', which translates to \'t=npt:3\', correctly requests playback starting from 3 seconds to the end of the media resource.\n    ','High','M143','testscriptsRDKV/component/webkit',_binary '\0','','\n    TC0034: To verify that a URL-encoded fragment (\'t%3D3\') is not recognized as a valid media fragment and the user agent plays the entire media resource from the start.\n    TC0035: To verify that a URL-encoded fragment (\'%74=3\') is correctly interpreted as a valid media fragment and that the media plays from 3 seconds to the end.\n    TC0036: To verify that a URL-encoded fragment (\'t=%33\') is correctly interpreted as a valid media fragment and that the media plays from 3 seconds to the end.\n    TC0037: To verify that a URL-encoded fragment (\'t=3%2C7\') is correctly interpreted as a valid media fragment requesting playback from 3 to 7 seconds.\n    TC0038: To verify that a URL-encoded fragment (\'t=%6Ept:3\') is correctly interpreted and the media is requested from 3 seconds to the end, where %6E is equivalent to n.\n    TC0039: To verify that a URL-encoded fragment (\'t=npt%3A3\') is correctly interpreted and the media is requested from 3 seconds to the end.\n  ','Mediafragments_13','401d2467-97b0-43f7-aba0-7e8604ed5a87','2132fb29-69db-4a8c-a079-44a344d6a63e',NULL),('54865059-f09f-496a-809f-a42dc3996db8','2025-10-07 13:11:30.589679','2025-10-07 13:11:30.589679','RDKV_RDKSERVICE',15,_binary '\0','RDKV_CERT_AVS_RemoteControl','None','HIGH','','testscriptsRDKV/component/rdkservices',_binary '\0',NULL,'To Test RDKService RemoteControl APIs','None','ac3c1912-0579-4bdd-9ede-5161b2dc757e','755d3ca6-6bc1-45b5-a183-2eb98203cc8f',NULL),('5495906e-f9a9-4388-9e4d-73f61817ac65','2025-10-07 13:20:38.719442','2025-10-07 13:20:38.719442','RDKV_RDKSERVICE',8,_binary '\0','RDKV_CERT_PVS_Functional_LightningApp_Reboot_OnLoadURL','The objective of this test is to load URL in LightningApp, reboot the device, check whether LightningApp is stable and able to load URL again in it once the device is online.','High','M95','testscriptsRDKV/certification/rdkv_performance',_binary '\0',NULL,'The objective of this test is to load URL in LightningApp, reboot the device, check whether LightningApp is stable and able to load URL again in it once the device is online.','RDKV_PERFORMANCE_85','6dc9e511-07f9-4ac8-a6dc-a448bd565afb','68ee7571-e08c-4b44-a662-2eb2b2813f84',NULL),('5496dac8-ead1-47a1-af6d-7e4adfb64757','2025-10-07 13:10:55.433533','2025-10-07 13:10:55.433533','RDKV',3,_binary '\0','PowerMgrHal_SetTempThresholds','Test Script to set high and critical temperature threshold values using PLAT_API_SetTempThresholds API','High','M77','testscriptsRDKV/component/PowerMgrHal',_binary '\0',NULL,'Test Script to set high and critical temperature threshold values using PLAT_API_SetTempThresholds API','TC_PowerMgrHal_05','a5d5288b-2a24-4d57-bd0c-af65fe02970c','235264b7-cb59-4433-82c3-682ffd0a81db',NULL),('549ee7f1-9027-4a7f-bb0b-518946867e2e','2025-11-14 07:33:13.521649','2025-11-14 07:33:13.521651','RDKV_RDKS