entTime == 3 and ends at currentTime == 7 as expected, and the extra ampersand characters are ignored.\n      TC0091: To ensure that trailing ampersand characters after a valid fragment do not interfere with the media fragment. The test should confirm that the video starts at currentTime == 3 and ends at currentTime == 7 as expected, with the trailing ampersand characters being ignored.\n    ','High','M143','testscriptsRDKV/component/webkit',_binary '\0','','\n    TC0088: To verify that additional ampersand characters, even if sprinkled at the end of a valid fragment like t=3,7, do not affect the expected behavior of the media playback.\n    TC0089: To verify that additional ampersand characters at the start of a fragment, like ampersandt=3,7, are ignored, and the video playback proceeds as expected from t=3 to t=7.\n    TC0090: To verify that multiple ampersand characters before a valid fragment (like ampersandampersandt=3,7) are ignored, and the video playback proceeds as expected from t=3 to t=7.\n    TC0091: To verify that trailing ampersand characters after a valid fragment (like ampersandt=3,7ampersand) are ignored, and the video playback proceeds as expected from t=3 to t=7.\n  ','Mediafragments_11','401d2467-97b0-43f7-aba0-7e8604ed5a87','2132fb29-69db-4a8c-a079-44a344d6a63e',NULL),('7339fbeb-b483-4aeb-ba14-3233324a5d4c','2025-10-07 13:12:11.982965','2025-10-07 13:12:11.982965','RDKV',5,_binary '\0','RDKLogger_Dbg_Enabled_Status','To check if a particular log level is enabled for a module','High','','testscriptsRDKV/component/rdk_logger',_binary '\0',NULL,'This tests the debug enabled status functionality of RDK Logger.\nTest Case ID: CT_RDKLogger_03\nTest Type: Positive','CT_RDKLogger_03','215b1c13-02a9-41f2-99aa-551922367357','75cdf7e6-710c-4951-9a6e-1f3567654476',NULL),('733e1f8b-5cfb-40ac-aa34-b5312c5e595c','2025-10-07 13:10:26.507676','2025-10-07 13:10:26.507676','RDKV',1,_binary '\0','MFRHal_Get_SerializedData_WPS_PIN','To retrieve wps_pin info from DUT