    ','High','M143','testscriptsRDKV/component/webkit',_binary '\0','','\n    TC0011: To verify that a media fragment request with \'t=3\' plays from time 3 to the end of the media.\n    TC0012: To verify that an invalid media fragment request with missing end time (\'t=3,\') is properly ignored.\n    TC0014: To verify that a media fragment request with a start time beyond the duration of the resource (\'t=15\') is handled correctly.\n    TC0015: To verify that a media fragment request with a missing start time (\'t=,7\') is interpreted correctly as requesting media from the start (0) to the specified end time (7).\n    TC0017: To verify that a media fragment request with a missing start time (\'t=,15\') is interpreted correctly as requesting media from the start (0) to the specified end time.\n    TC0072: To verify that the media fragment t=3. correctly requests playback from 3 seconds to the end of the media.\n  ','Mediafragments_08','401d2467-97b0-43f7-aba0-7e8604ed5a87','2132fb29-69db-4a8c-a079-44a344d6a63e',NULL),('742284f6-4ed4-4085-a2db-b0609a5ad016','2025-10-07 13:17:29.458355','2025-10-07 13:17:29.458355','RDKV_RDKSERVICE',5,_binary '\0','RDKV_CERT_MVS_Video_Play_Corrupted_I_P_Frames_Middle_H264_AAC','Test script to initiate the TDK Lightning Player application through a Webkit instance.The objective is to assess the player response when it receives corrupted I and P frames from the middle video segment of a clear stream,served via streaming server.','High','M133','testscriptsRDKV/certification/rdkv_media',_binary '\0',NULL,'Test script to initiate the TDK Lightning Player application through a Webkit instance.The objective is to assess the player response when it receives corrupted I and P frames from the middle video segment of a clear stream,served via streaming server.','RDKV_Media_Validation_533','c8488b19-6f19-46d3-8403-bad806977ac6','d3ef13e5-9c55-4150-a031-5986a2dbd2bc',NULL),('7438ed80-de30-4a89-b6ff-5dfa051d4148','2025-10-07 13:25:41.486423','2025